// rpart() are output components packed into rlist via SET_VECTOR_ELT and
// returned to Python.  They must outlive the ArenaFrame RAII guard that
// governs ALLOC / R_alloc scratch arrays.  The ArenaFrame destructor at
// .Call wrapper return does not free heap-allocated SEXPs.
//
// Invariant 3 (Python function-pointer bridges): Not applicable.
// allocMatrix is not an R Interpreter Item.
//
// Memory lifecycle:
//   SEXPREC node + data buffer   malloc() in allocVector    Python: free_sexp()
//   Column-pointer scratch arrays arena via ALLOC/R_alloc   ArenaFrame destructor
//
// Source context note (rpart.c:292-301): csplit3 is conditionally allocated
